# Padrão de .gitignore recomendado para projetos .NET (Visual Studio)

## Ignore Visual Studio temporary files, build results, and
## files generated by popular Visual Studio add-ons.
##
## Get latest from https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/VisualStudio.gitignore

*.[Ss]u[oO]
*.[Uu]ser
*.[Uu]ser[Cc]onfig
*.[Cc]onfig.user
*.aps
*.opensdf
*.opendb
*.sdf
*.cache
*.VC.db
*.VC.VC.opendb
*.pdb

# Ignore Visual Studio Build folders
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/

# Ignore other potentially sensitive files
*.local
secrets.json
appsettings.Development.json